#Requires AutoHotkey v2.0

/*	Keybindings
	Save Screenshot			- PrintScreen + F1
	+						  PrintScreen +  1
	Save Clip				- PrintScreen + F2
	+						  PrintScreen +  2
	Start/Stop Recording	- PrintScreen + F3
	+                         PrintScreen +  3
*/

PrintScreen & 1:: F22
PrintScreen & 2:: F23
PrintScreen & 3:: F24

PrintScreen & F1:: F22
PrintScreen & F2:: F23
PrintScreen & F3:: F24

PrintScreen:: PrintScreen